abstract: >-
  Paper, Lean 4 formalization with Mathlib, and reproducible numerics for
  adaptive estimation of a threshold probability from noisy coins.
  Code and Lean files use Apache-2.0; the paper and documentation use
  CC BY 4.0. Claim scopes are distinguished in the README and docs/RESULTS.md.
